@startuml QAS01_Implementation_DCD
title QAS-01 신뢰성 구현 DCD · 레이어드 모놀리스
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

package "인터페이스 계층" {
  class "FastAPI routes\n(TransactionController)" as Controller
  class DeadlineRecoveryRunner {
    +start()
    +deadlines()
    +verifications()
    +transfers()
    +stop()
  }
}
package "업무 계층" {
  class TransactionService {
    +register_return_waybill(...)
    +evaluate(transaction_id, snapshot)
    +process_due_deadlines()
    +verify_receipt(receipt)
    +dispatch_transfers()
    +get_transaction_status(...)
  }
  class PolicyController {
    +evaluate(transaction, now): Decision
  }
  class ReturnPolicy {
    +evaluate(transaction, now): Decision
  }
  class DeadlinePolicy {
    +deadline_of(notice_published_at)
    +is_before_deadline(received_at, deadline)
  }
  interface DeliveryPort {
    +get_shipment_status(waybill_no, seller_id): ShipmentResult
  }
  interface BankPort {
    +transfer(operation): str
  }
}
package "인프라 계층" {
  class SqlTransactionRepository {
    +accept_waybill(..., clock)
    +claim_once(snapshot, decision, now)
    +claim_receipt(now)
    +finish_receipt(...)
    +save_transfer_result(...)
  }
  class MockDeliveryPort
  class MockBankPort
  database "SQLite\ntransactions / receipts / operations\nmock_bank_transfers / events" as DB
}
Controller --> TransactionService
DeadlineRecoveryRunner --> TransactionService
TransactionService --> PolicyController
PolicyController --> ReturnPolicy
ReturnPolicy --> DeadlinePolicy
TransactionService --> SqlTransactionRepository : Repository + RequestGuard
TransactionService --> DeliveryPort
TransactionService --> BankPort
MockDeliveryPort ..|> DeliveryPort
MockBankPort ..|> BankPort
MockBankPort --> SqlTransactionRepository : 영속 모의 은행 원장
SqlTransactionRepository --> DB
note right of SqlTransactionRepository
  접수 시각·PENDING·버전 원자 저장
  버전 비교·원금 지시 원자 저장
  UNIQUE(transaction_id): 지급/환불 한 자리
  외부 응답 대기 중 DB 잠금 없음
end note
note bottom of DeadlineRecoveryRunner
  하나의 백엔드 프로세스
  마감 실행과 택배/은행 대기를 분리
  접수는 DB에 남아 재시작 후 재조회
end note
@enduml
